---
import { getPmiReading, type HomepageNotableSignal } from '../../data/home';
const { signal, relationshipHref = '/graph' } = Astro.props as { signal: HomepageNotableSignal; relationshipHref?: string };
---

<section class="home-hero" id="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-hero-title">
  <div class="home-hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow">MacroLens · 宏观经济观察与学习</div>
    <h1 id="home-hero-title">看懂经济，<br /><span>而不只是<span class="home-title-word">看数据。</span></span></h1>
    <p class="lead">从一个指标出发，理解它释放的信号，<br class="home-desktop-break" />再看它与经济的联系。</p>
    <div class="home-hero-actions">
      <a class="home-button home-button-primary" href="#macro-state">看当前宏观状态</a>
      <a class="home-button home-button-secondary" href={relationshipHref}>探索宏观关系</a>
    </div>
    <a class="home-learning-entry" href="#learning-paths">刚开始了解宏观？从一条学习路径开始 →</a>
  </div>

  <aside class="home-hero-map" aria-labelledby="home-observation-title">
    <div class="home-observation-top"><span class="eyebrow">从一个信号开始</span><time>{signal.observationPeriod}</time></div>
    <h2 id="home-observation-title">{signal.name}</h2>
    <div class="home-observation-value">{signal.latest.toFixed(1)}<span>指数</span></div>
    <p class="home-observation-reading">{getPmiReading(signal)}</p>
    <p>读数的变化与所处位置，是理解景气的两个角度。</p>
    <a class="home-inline-link" href={signal.conceptHref}>了解 PMI 与荣枯线 →</a>
  </aside>
</section>
